  ('cd82ddb7-5d87-473f-8af5-9d1f0ea3815f','69fe8a56-3764-4996-8fdf-92e47ce38dd9',0,'Definition of a day visitor and an overnight guest, applying to every College House, every summer program, and every conference group: 10:00 pm is the cutoff. A guest who leaves by 10:00 pm is a day visitor. A guest who stays past 10:00 pm is an overnight guest. Therefore a program whose rules allow day visitors but do not allow overnight guests may have guests up to 10:00 pm, and may not have guests after 10:00 pm. A program''s own listed curfew, where it has one, applies in addition to this cutoff.','[-0.020237867,-0.03321551,-0.010754202,-0.057355747,0.01842281,0.001917152,0.007577856,0.020600878,-0.006942587,0.05191058,0.0005275,-0.014338937,-0.033578523,0.012342376,0.004809896,-0.044105843,-0.018150553,0.029040884,0.047191437,0.02432174,-0.02595529,0.026862819,0.062800914,-0.020147113,-0.0147927,-0.053725637,0.05880779,-0.031037444,-0.007214845,0.002620486,0.018876575,0.014883453,-0.016698508,-0.057355747,0.047191437,0.022415932,0.057718758,0.002688551,0.00213269,0.044831865,0.027770346,0.011253343,-0.051184557,0.016880013,-0.005944306,-0.001610862,0.028859379,0.011888612,0.023777224,-0.00188312,-0.04465036,-0.000300619,-0.05445166,0.020419372,0.00789549,0.0426538,-0.001815055,0.002019249,0.012433128,0.000567205,0.036301106,0.049006492,-0.03121895,0.028496368,-0.009937428,0.040475734,-0.05808177,-0.014157431,-0.05517768,-0.033034004,-0.027044324,-0.013522162,-0.027044324,0.01969335,-0.059896823,-0.05227359,-0.022597438,-0.003448605,-0.057355747,0.030129917,0.002688551,0.04791746,0.055903703,-0.015881734,-0.010345815,-0.010300439,0.032670993,-0.005127531,0.00853076,0.008803018,-0.033578523,-0.03775315,-0.006125811,-0.023414213,0.025047762,0.005649359,-0.030492928,-0.051184557,-0.001565485,0.035212073,-0.000490632,-0.0295854,0.030674433,-0.016335497,-0.001542797,-0.00451495,0.030674433,-0.0295854,0.02395873,0.002790648,-0.007986243,0.028133357,0.01905808,0.001599517,-0.011344096,0